# Fonts

Place your custom font files here.

Usage in pubspec.yaml:
```yaml
fonts:
  - family: YourFontFamily
    fonts:
      - asset: assets/fonts/YourFont-Regular.ttf
      - asset: assets/fonts/YourFont-Bold.ttf
        weight: 700
```

Usage in code:
```dart
Text(
  'Hello',
  style: TextStyle(fontFamily: 'YourFontFamily'),
)
```
